# Biss_Automation_Playwright

The BISS / ENTS BDD Cucumber automation framework for DAFM, running on **Playwright for Java**.
It is a one-to-one migration of the Selenium framework (`Biss_Automation`): the same feature files, step texts,
Object Repository keys, Excel files and folder layout. The Selenium project stays as it is until this one reaches parity.

> Everything in this repository is for human review. No generated code is committed to the government repository
> without a review.

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| Language / build | Java 17, Maven (wrapper) |
| Browser engine | Playwright for Java 1.61.0 (installed Chrome, or Chromium in Docker) |
| BDD | Cucumber-JVM 7.15.0, JUnit 5 |
| Test selection | `Execution_Control_File/ExecutionControl.xlsx` (Execution = Y), or `-Dtestcase.ids=...` |
| Test data | `Test_Data/TestData.xlsx` (passwords) + Oracle at run time (DATA, INET, ENTS) + Test Data Vault |
| Locators | `Object_Repository/ObjectRepository.properties` (Selenium XPaths, `xpath=` prefix added at run time) |
| Execution | IntelliJ / Maven on the laptop; Docker planned (`mcr.microsoft.com/playwright/java:v1.61.0-noble`) |

