## 3. Test suites

| Suite | Test cases | Who logs in | Herd / login source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Data | `TC_00_DATA` | nobody (no browser) | fills the Test Data Vault |
| Login | `TC_01_Login`, `TC_02_InvalidCredentials_Login` | agent | TestData.xlsx |
| BISS agent | `TC_03` - `TC_10` | agent | DATA "List of herds with no errors at all" + INET agent |
| BISS individual | `TC_03_IND` | the farmer | DATA "not started individual herds with CISYF flag" + INET own login |
| BISS partnership | `TC_03_PART` | agent of the partnership herd | DATA "List of not started partnership herds" + INET agent |
| Preliminary Checks | `TC_15` - `TC_20` | agent | DATA Preliminary Check queries (Pending) |
| ENTS transfers | `TC_01_ENTS` - `TC_12_ENTS`, `TC_17_ENTS` - `TC_20_ENTS` | agent, individual, ETF partner | ENTS Agent / Individual / ETF queries |
| ENTS NR/CISYF | `TC_13_ENTS`, `TC_15_ENTS`, `TC_16_ENTS`, `TC_21_ENTS` - `TC_25_ENTS` | agent | ENTS "Young Farmer herds" |
| ENTS ETF | `TC_14_ENTS` | individual, then ETF partner | random ETF from the dropdown + "ENTS ETF logins" |
| Staff | `TC_01_STAFF` - `TC_37_STAFF` | staff (internal portal) | StaffTestData pools (DATA) |

The test case type is read from its ID: `_ENTS`, `_IND`, `_PART`, `_STAFF`, `_DATA`. Column C of
ExecutionControl.xlsx describes every test case in two lines (what it does, then the technical flow).

