## 5. Configuration (application.properties)

Most used settings. Any setting can also be passed as `-Dname=value`.

| Setting | Default | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `browser.reuse` | true | one browser for the whole run, clean session per test case |
| `browser.zoom.percent` | 67 | Chrome page zoom, same as the Selenium framework |
| `browser.profile.delete` | background | delete the temporary zoom profile without holding up the end of the run |
| `trace.mode` | retain-on-failure | Playwright trace kept for failed test cases only |
| `probe.timeout.seconds` | 3 | how long an "if present" check waits |
| `login.screen.wait.seconds` | 15 | wait for the screen after Login (new-user Next screens, PIN, OTP) |
| `clients.list.timeout.seconds` | 45 | wait for the My Clients filter bar |
| `ents.scheme.year` | 2026 | ENTS herds must hold entitlements in this year |
| `ents.individual.min.ents` | 10 | individual herds must hold more than this many entitlements (-1 = off) |
| `ents.pair.retries` | 15 | transfer pairs tried before a create step fails |
| `ents.transferee.retries` | 3 | transferees tried on "No transferee matches were found" |
| `data.vault.enabled` | true | take herds from the vault first |
| `staff.url` | (blank) | staff login page; blank = StaffURL column of the Config sheet |
| `staff.pool.size` | 20 | rows per staff data pool (tags like `@parcels:10` ask for more) |

