## 7. Security rules

- `src/test/resources/db.properties` holds the database credentials and is git-ignored. Share
  `db.properties.example` (empty values) instead.
- `TestData.xlsx` holds passwords. Do not attach it to tickets or chats.
- Trace zips contain typed passwords and cookies. Do not share them outside the team.
- `runtime-data/` (vault, used-herds file) holds farmer names and herd numbers and is git-ignored.
- Never put a Windows password in a proxy URL.

